      "writtenOn": "2019-02-13T21:07:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The scheme is a hack to enforce the \"a\" section attribute (allocatable. The interesting bit here is that there are no other attributes). The @ then comments out the rest of the line where gcc puts its own default section attributes (that aren\u0027t overridable).",
